Aether Engine
https://github.com/djburkhart/aether

Aether modernizes Sony World Wide Studios authoring tools into a
tools-first, open-source C# game engine.

Upstream sources (Apache License 2.0):
- ATF: https://github.com/SonyWWS/ATF  (fork: https://github.com/djburkhart/ATF)
- LevelEditor: https://github.com/SonyWWS/LevelEditor  (fork: https://github.com/djburkhart/LevelEditor)
- SLED: https://github.com/SonyWWS/SLED  (fork: https://github.com/djburkhart/SLED)

