`src/Aether.Atf.Core` is a derivative of SonyWWS ATF `Framework/Atf.Core`
(namespace `Sce.Atf`). `src/Aether.Atf.Commands` is a derivative of the
logic-only command / undo / history / document slice of
`Framework/Atf.Gui`. See PORTING.md for the portable subset and cuts.

Stride Engine (MIT), used as the preferred runtime foundation:
